%% Architecture diagram for "Designing an Adaptive System — Episode 1"
%% Import into Excalidraw: excalidraw.com → toolbar "extra tools" icon →
%% "Mermaid to Excalidraw" → paste this file → Insert. Shapes become editable.
%% (Fallback importer: https://mermaid-to-excalidraw.vercel.app)

flowchart TB
    MD["Market Data<br/>Daily end-of-day prices<br/>for the full NSE universe"]

    subgraph FAST["DAILY FAST PATH — runs every trading day"]
        direction TB
        UA["Universe Agent<br/>Scores the field by activity and liquidity.<br/>Keeps only the most tradable names.<br/>Decides what is even eligible today."]
        ST["5 Strategies<br/>Each independently proposes BUY / SELL / HOLD.<br/>Momentum, breakout, trend, mean-reversion.<br/>Five opinions, often conflicting."]
        RT["MultiStrategy Router<br/>Merges the five proposals.<br/>Resolves conflicts on the same symbol.<br/>Enforces position ownership.<br/>Emits one decision per symbol."]
        RA["Risk Agent<br/>Sizes each trade against a risk budget.<br/>Trailing stop, breadth circuit breaker, cash gate.<br/>Can shrink or veto any trade."]
        EX["Execution<br/>Turns approved decisions into fills.<br/>Applies costs and slippage."]
    end

    PF["Portfolio<br/>Open positions, cash, running P&L"]

    subgraph META["WEEKLY META LAYER — sets the weights the router uses"]
        direction TB
        RC["Regime Context Agent<br/>Reads broad-market breadth and volatility.<br/>Classifies the current regime.<br/>Deterministic — no model here."]
        AS["Adaptive Selector (LLM)<br/>Given the regime label, allocates capital<br/>across the five strategies.<br/>Output clamped by hard-coded bounds."]
    end

    MD --> UA --> ST --> RT --> RA --> EX --> PF
    PF -. current holdings feed the stop checks .-> RA
    MD --> RC --> AS
    AS == weekly strategy weights ==> RT

    classDef source fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4285f4,stroke-width:2px,color:#111;
    classDef meta fill:#fef7e0,stroke:#f4b400,stroke-width:2px,color:#111;
    classDef sink fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#34a853,stroke-width:2px,color:#111;
    class MD source;
    class RC,AS meta;
    class PF sink;
